# 6. Authorized Pickup

Authorized pickup must be separate from emergency contacts.

Someone can be an emergency contact without automatically being authorized to pick up a child.

Create AuthorizedPickup:

* Id
* ChildId
* PersonId
* Relationship
* PickupCode
* PhotoUrl
* ValidFrom
* ValidTo
* IsActive
* Notes

Support pickup restrictions.

Create ChildPersonRestriction:

* ChildId
* PersonId
* RestrictionType
* EffectiveFrom
* EffectiveTo
* Notes

This information is safety-critical.

